{"inkVersion":20,"root":[[["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"stranger_1":["^Not now, I'm busy. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"stranger_2":["^Not in the mood right now. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"stranger_3":["^You're wasting my time farmer. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"stranger_4":["^No small talk, thanks. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"acquaintance_1":["^Listen farmer, I don't have time for your low IQ inquiries.",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"acquaintance_2":["^Why are you so inclined to constantly disturb me? ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"acquaintance_3":["^You again? ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Why? ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"acquaintance_4":["^Please leave your brain dead farming queries for some other simpleton, like Bryan for example. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"friend_1":["^Your constant persistance to annoy me is starting to get scientifically interesting. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^What is your process behind this? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"friend_2":["^Why would somebody like you do such a brain dead job like farming? ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^You don't seem intellectually useless to me. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"friend_3":["^You always seem to show up when I don't have the time or nerve. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^What is the mathematical probability of that? ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"friend_4":["^You're here for more block brain small talk? ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Make it quick, what do you have to say? ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"goodfriend_1":["^It's getting to the point where the probability of you speaking to me when in proximity is near 100 percent. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^The last person to have a value that high is Miya. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"goodfriend_2":["^It seems like farming takes some high intellect. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^I may have more error in my assumptions than previously intended. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Will have to make those adjustments accordingly. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"goodfriend_3":["^The lack of incentive of scientific advancement in this town is very idiotic. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Does the mayor want his people to be well dressed cavemen like him forever? ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"goodfriend_4":["^My twin sister Miya is quite an brilliant mind. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Yet, she refuses to put it into practice and does a mind numbing job instead. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^How ignorant could one be? ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"bestfriend_1":["^Hey *player* how are the operations on the farm going? ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Are you optimizing your soil quality and crop rotation? ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Let me know and I can test your soil quality in the lab. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"bestfriend_2":["^Have you ever heard of chaos theory *player*? ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^It's the concept of where one small change can create big difference in a system. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Nature continues to show this theory in practice. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Weather is a great example of this, making it so hard to predict it in advance. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"bestfriend_3":["^I have to say, I was wrong about your intellect *player*. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^My error was so large, I should quit being a scientist and be like that fat alcoholic rancher. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^But I'll wear it on the chin and learn from it. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","^I'd rather die than be that obese simpleton. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"bestfriend_4":["^I've been stumped on my research for quite awhile now. ",{"#":"speaker:Kane"},{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^But that just motivates me even more to solve these puzzles. ",{"#":"emotion:happy"},"\n","^This is causing me to sleep on the lab's couch. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^This annoys my mother and Miya, which annoys me that it annoys them. ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","^Can't they tell I'm doing all this for their future health? ",{"#":"emotion:neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"two_hearts_scene":["^The mayor's place is right this- ",{"#":"speaker: Eugene"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I know where the mayor resides. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I don't need you to escort me. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Ok... ",{"#":"speaker: Eugene"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Hey I don't think we met yet. ",{"#":"speaker: Lucas"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^I'm Lucas! ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^I don't recall asking Lucas. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I also don't believe you're Mayor Johnson correct? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Well I just wanted- ",{"#":"speaker: Lucas"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Awesome I don't care. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Excuse me. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Wow what's his deal? ",{"#":"speaker: Lucas"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^He's... always like that... ",{"#":"speaker: Eugene"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Doesn't talk to anyone but his sister Miya. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^At least from what I've seen. ",{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Well I can see why. ",{"#":"speaker: Lucas"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"four_hearts_scene":["^Miya you have to understand. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^My research determines more than you know! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It's more important than anything right now. ",{"#":"speaker: Miya"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^More important than family? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Mom is worried sick about you. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You haven't seen her for more than a year! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Do you not care about her? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Of course I care about her! ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I have a job to do. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Now leave me alone to my research! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Kane you don't know how much longer grammy's got. ",{"#":"speaker: Miya"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Don't make a decision you'll regret. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Stop guilt tripping me Miya! ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Leave damnit! ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"speaker: Miya"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Sighhh Miya I- ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You made your choice. ",{"#":"speaker: Miya"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Damnit... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"six_hearts_scene":["^Look who it is grammy! ",{"#":"speaker: Miya"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Who are you? ",{"#":"speaker: Grammy"},"\n","^It's Kane grammy. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Your son Kane. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Oh Kaney! ",{"#":"speaker: Grammy"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^I haven't seen you in forever. ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^You look skinny have you been eating enough? ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Yes grammy. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Where have you been? ",{"#":"speaker: Grammy"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Are you in school? ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^I've been in the lab working. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Well don't work too hard Kaney. ",{"#":"speaker: Grammy"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^You'll make me worried. ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Don't worry grammy I'll be alright. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'm so proud of both of you two. ",{"#":"speaker: Grammy"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^My two super stars. ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Now how did I get here? ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^And who are you guys? ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Grammy it's your two grandchildren Kane and Miya. ",{"#":"speaker: Miya"},{"#":"emotion: happy"},"\n","^Nooooo my two grandkids are 10 years old. ",{"#":"speaker: Grammy"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^They're still in school. ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^I think the first day of school is today. ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^I gotta go pack them lunch. ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^I always add some sweets for them. ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^I spoil them kids! ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Ok let's go fix them lunch. ",{"#":"speaker: Miya"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'm not sure who you are. ",{"#":"speaker: Grammy"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^I can get home myself. ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Oh wow you're a handsome man. ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Miya should date a man like you. ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'm your grandson Kane. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^No Kane is in school right now. ",{"#":"speaker: Grammy"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^He's only 10 years old! ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Oh Grammy... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":1}],"eight_hearts_scene":[["^Huh? ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^What are you doing here *player*? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^The lab is for authorized personnel only. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Sorry the door was unlocked and I thought I'd stop by. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^I can leave if you want. ",{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^No that's alright... ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I'm not sure how the door was even open... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Just please don't touch anything. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Why do you treat me so well? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I usually can logic my way through most things. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Miya, Mom, and Grammy are nice because they are family. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^We share the same DNA. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Yet you... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Confuse me... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You have no reason to treat me the way that you do. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You're here just to check on me. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That bewilders me... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^So tell me... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Why do you treat me so well despite how I am? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n",["ev",{"^->":"eight_hearts_scene.0.63.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Treat others how I want to be treated",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"eight_hearts_scene.0.64.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^Cause why not?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"eight_hearts_scene.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.63.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Well I like to treat others how I'd want to be treated. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Hmm... ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^By that logic I ought to be hated by everyone. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^By that logic my family should shun me. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Yet none of those things are true. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That answer did not help me whatsoever. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^So thanks for nothing... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","done",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"eight_hearts_scene.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.64.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^I don't know why not? ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Huh? ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^What kind of idiotic answer is that? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You sound like a child that just do stupid things because of lack of common sense. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","done","^Sighhh I apologize... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^There's just a lot going on. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^A lot on my plate. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^With my research. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Grammy... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^But I need to run more tests. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^So I need you to leave. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^But I'll give you the code to get in the lab. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^But if you touch anything then you lose that privledge. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"ten_hearts_scene":[["^Good day *player*. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Hey Kane. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Don't touch anything. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I won't. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^What brings you to my lab today? ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Just thought I'd stop by. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Yes of course... ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Do you understand what I do *player*? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And why I do it? ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n",["ev",{"^->":"ten_hearts_scene.0.37.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Yes I know!",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"ten_hearts_scene.0.38.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^No idea",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"ten_hearts_scene.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.37.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Yes I know! ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^No you don't. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Liar. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","done",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"ten_hearts_scene.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.38.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^I have no idea. ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^Figured so. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","done","^Well my research consists of finding cures for the incurable diseases that the human race faces on a daily basis. ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^More specifically nervous system type diseases. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^To put it simply for your small head, brain diseases. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Like Dementia, Alzheimers, ALS, etc. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^My research is specifically focused on Alzheimers and Dementia. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Those are the ones I must find a cure to. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^There isn't any other option. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Because your Grammy has Alzheimers? ",{"#":"speaker: *player*"},{"#":"emotion: none"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"speaker: Kane"},{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^So you know about my grandmother then... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Yes she has a case of Alzheimers. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It's a very difficult to watch. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Just watching someone you love slowly lose their cognitive function... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It's a feeling you'd wouldn't wish on your worst enemy. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And it always seems that these diseases impact the most kind and gentle people. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Like Grammy... ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Miya just takes care of Grammy despite knowing that she's getting worse. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It's taking a toll on her. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Miya doesn't deserve that either. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^She's doing something I could never do. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^So my research is finding a cure for my Grammy. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And let Miya take pressure of herself. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^That's why I'm in the lab most hours of the day. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Because she isn't getting any better. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^But I know I can find the cure to it. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^There's always an answer to any problem. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And when I find the cure, not only will I save Grammy. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^But I can put an end to this evil disease so that nobody has to experience it again. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Since Grammy has the disease, then there's a chance that Mom, Miya, and I can get the disease as well. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^It's how genetics work. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And I'll be damned if Miya or Mom get the disease because I couldn't find a cure. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^So that's why I do what I do. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Why I work here in the lab. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^I figured you were going to ask at some point. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^And I feel like you deserve to know. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^So I better back to finding a cure. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^You can stay as long as you like. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","^Just don't touch anything. ",{"#":"emotion: neutral"},"\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"get_random_knot_by_relation":["ev",{"VAR?":"relation"},"/ev",["du","ev","str","^stranger","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"get_random_stranger_knot"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^acquaintance","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"get_random_acquaintance_knot"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^friend","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"get_random_friend_knot"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^goodfriend","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"get_random_goodfriend_knot"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],["du","ev","str","^bestfriend","/str","==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"get_random_bestfriend_knot"},{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"pop","nop","\n",{"#f":1}],"get_random_stranger_knot":["ev",1,4,"rnd","/ev",["du","ev",1,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"stranger_1"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],["du","ev",2,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"stranger_2"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],["du","ev",3,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"stranger_3"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],["du","ev",4,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"stranger_4"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],"pop","nop","\n",{"#f":1}],"get_random_acquaintance_knot":["ev",1,4,"rnd","/ev",["du","ev",1,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"acquaintance_1"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],["du","ev",2,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["pop","\n",{"->":"acquaintance_2"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],["du","ev",3,"==","/ev",{"->":".^